<p>A special event recognizing Mandan businesses with at least 50 years of operation was held July 21, 2025. Photographs from around the city highlighting key changes were on display at our local history museum. Certificates were given to almost 50 area businesses in recognition of their operation during the past 50 years. The awards were presented by Mandan City Mayor Jim Froelich and Historical Society President Bob Potter. Free cake and lemonade were served.</p>

