<p>Image:</p>

<p>The event was held in conjuction with the 2025 "Watermelon Days" at the ND State Railroad Museum. The annual event promotes awareness of Mandan's historic connection to the state's railroad industry. Free watermelon was available to all. The mini-train was in full operation and gave rides to the kids. The new train layout was in full operation for train enthusaists of all ages. The event was open to the public and free of charge. Join us for next year's event!</p>
